{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Siamo obbedienti.","note":"نحن مطيعون."},{"btype":"example","text":"Fadil amava Dania incondizionatamente.","note":"كان حبّ فاضل لدانية غير مشروط."},{"btype":"example","text":"Difendi l'Algeria.","note":"دافعوا عن الجزائر."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom ha ripagato Mary.","note":"أعاد توم المال لماري."},{"btype":"example","text":"Partecipi a tutte le riunioni.","note":"انتم تحضرون كل الاجتماعات."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ascoltate, gentiluomini.","note":"اسمعوا يا سادة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Layla voleva rapinare una banca.","note":"كانت تريد ليلى أن تسرق مصرفا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Layla ha pianificato di rapinare una banca.","note":"كانت ليلى تخطّط لسرقة مصرف."},{"btype":"example","text":"Quali materiali assorbono l'acqua?","note":"ما هي المواد التي تمتص الماء؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Questi asciugamani assorbono l'acqua.","note":"هذه المنشفات تمتص الماء."},{"btype":"example","text":"Gli asciugamani di carta assorbono l'acqua.","note":"تستطيع المناشف الورقية امتصاص الماء."},{"btype":"example","text":"In che modo gli asciugamani assorbono l'acqua?","note":"كيف تمتصّ المنشفات الماء."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"it","lang_name":"الإيطالية","sentences":[{"t":"Siamo obbedienti.","ar":"نحن مطيعون."},{"t":"Fadil amava Dania incondiz